        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo akaza aha ngoma aine emyaka makumi ashatu, yaamara emyaka ebiri naategyeka Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Saulo yaatoorana abashaija enkumi ishatu omu Baisraeli; enkumi ibiri zaaguma na Saulo Mikimaashi n'aha kibungo kya Beseeli; kandi orukumi rwaguma na Yonasaani omuri Gibea eya Benyamiini; abandi boona yaabaraga, buri muntu yaataaha omu ka ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yonasaani yaateera ekigo ky'Abafilistia ekyabaire kiri Gibea; Abafilistia baakimanya. Bwanyima Saulo yaaragiira kuteera enzamba omu nsi yoona, naagira ati: Abaheburaayo bahurire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.34.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 34:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abaisraeli boona baahurira ngu Saulo ateire ekigo ky'Abafilistia, kandi ngu Abaisraeli bahindukire ekirikunugwa aha Bafilistia. Abantu baahuruzibwa kushanga Saulo Gilugaali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abafilistia baayeteerana kurwanisa Abaisraeli, baine ebigaari obukumi bushatu, n'ab'aha mbaraasi enkumi mukaaga, n'ezindi ngabo nyingi, eziri nk'omusheenyi gw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja; bainamuka, baasiisira Mikimaashi, aha burugwa-izooba bwa Besaveeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 6:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abashaija ba Israeli ku baareebire bari omu kabi, (ahakuba abantu bakaba batuntuziibwe) baayeshereka omu nyanga n'omu bishaka n'omu nkiri n'omu nengo kandi n'omu biina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abaheburaayo abamwe bakaba bambukire Yorudani, nibaza omu nsi ya Gaadi na Gileadi; kwonka Saulo akaba akiri Gilugaali, abantu boona baamukuratayo nibatetema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Saulo yaamarayo ebiro mushanju, ebi Samueli yaabaire amuragiire; kwonka Samueli tiyaija; n'ahabw'ekyo abantu baatandika kutaataana nibamurugaho mporampora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.26.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 26:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.5.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 5:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Saulo nikwo kugira ati: Mundeetere ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. Atyo yaatamba ekyo kitambo ky'okwotsya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaabaire yaaheza ati kukitamba, Samueli yaija. Saulo yaashohora kumubugana, ngu amuramutsye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli yaamubuuza ati: Eki waakora ki? Saulo yaamugarukamu ati: Ku ndeebire abantu baatandika kutaataana nibampwaho, naiwe otaizira mu biro bi ongambiire, kandi n'Abafilistia baateeraniire Mikimaashi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naanye nikwo kugira nti: Hati Abafilistia baaza kushuuma, banteerere Gilugaali, ntakeeshengyereize MUKAMA kumpa omugisha. Nikyo nyegyemeserereize kutamba ekitambo ky'okwotsya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.12.7+2SA.12.8+2SA.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 12:7-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.16.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 16:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Samueli yaagambira Saulo ati: Waakora eky'obushema; tiwaakwata kiragiro kya MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, eki yaakuragiire; reeba MUKAMA yaaba ari ow'okuhamya obugabe bwawe omuri Israeli ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.2.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 2:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 13:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka mbwenu obugabe bwawe tiburigumaho. MUKAMA yaaheza kwesherurira omuntu ori nk'omutima gwe oku gurikwenda, kandi niwe yaataho kuba omugabe w'abantu be, ahakuba tokwatsire ki MUKAMA yaakuragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli yaimuka, yaaruga Gilugaali, yaaza Gibea eya Benyamiini. Saulo yaabara abantu abu yaabaire aine, baaba nka magana mukaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo n'omutabani Yonasaani n'abantu abu baabaire baine baaguma Geeba eya Benyamiini; kwonka Abafilistia baaguma omu rusiisira Mikimaashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abanyagi b'omu Bafilistia baaruga omu rusiisira rwabo, baayecwamu emitwe eshatu; ogumwe gwatoora omuhanda ogurikuza Ofura omu nsi ya Shuali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogundi gwatoora omuhanda ogurikuza Besi-horoni; n'ogundi gwatoora omuhanda ogw'aha mwatano ogurikureeba omu ruhanga rwa Zeboimu haihi n'eihamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 24:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu biro ebyo hakaba hatariho muheesi n'omwe omu nsi ya Israeli; ahabw'okuba Abafilistia bakagira bati: Abaheburaayo batakaayeheeshera zaarurara n'amacumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Abaisraeli boona bakaba bashuuma omu Bafilistia, buri muntu kutyazayo efuka ye, oruhabyo rwe, empango ye, n'omuhoro gwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.13.20",
